6. Full Learning Specification
6.1 Learning Schema
The learning schema defines the structure of a learning record deposit.

It has the following fields:

learning_id. A string. Required.

concept_name. A string. Required.

concept_description. A string. Required.

subject. A string. Required.

topic. A string. Required.

evidence_of_understanding. An array of evidence objects. Required.

prior_concepts. An array of concept relation objects. Optional.

related_concepts. An array of concept relation objects. Optional.

applied_in_contexts. An array of context objects. Optional.

proficiency. An object. Required. It contains level and last_assessed.

student_id. A string. Required.

date_learned. A string in ISO8601 format. Required.

date_last_reviewed. A string in ISO8601 format. Optional.

source_of_learning. An array of source objects. Required.

related_learning_records. An array of learning relations. Optional.

method_reference. A string. Optional.

provenance. An object. Required.

stag_annotation. An object. Optional.

work_reference. A string. Optional.

keywords. An array of strings. Optional.

notes. A string. Optional.

moderation_status. An enum. The values are pending, approved, rejected.

version. An integer.

supersedes. A string. Optional.

superseded_by. A string. Optional.

Each evidence object has:

evidence_id. A string.

evidence_type. An enum. The values are assessment, demonstration, application, explanation, project, experiment, other.

description. A string.

date. A string in ISO8601 format.

source_reference. A string. Optional.

result. An enum. The values are correct, partial, incorrect, not_assessed.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each concept relation object has:

relation_id. A string.

related_concept_id. A string.

related_concept_name. A string.

relation_type. An enum. The values are prerequisite, builds_on, related, special_case, generalisation, alternative, independent.

relation_note. A string. Optional.

Each context object has:

context_id. A string.

context_name. A string.

context_description. A string.

date_applied. A string in ISO8601 format.

Each source object has:

source_id. A string.

source_type. An enum. The values are course, book, lecture, video, project, experiment, conversation, self_study, other.

source_reference. A string.

source_description. A string.

Each learning relation has:

relation_id. A string.

related_learning_id. A string.

relation_type. An enum. The values are same_concept, prerequisite, applied, related, independent.

relation_note. A string. Optional.

The proficiency level has four values:

novice.

developing.

proficient.

advanced.

