6.3 Referential Integrity
Every evidence.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every concept_relation.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every context.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every source.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every learning_relation.learning_id and learning_relation.related_learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every method_link.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every stag_link.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every work_link.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every provenance.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

Every moderation.learning_id must exist in learning_record.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The learning relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

