12. Validation Engine Design
The system validates the following.

Validation 1. Learning record validity. Every learning record is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. STAG annotation validity.

Validation 3. Referential integrity.

Validation 4. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 5. Method resolution. Every method_reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 6. Work resolution. Every work_reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 7. Provenance completeness.

Validation 8. Audit completeness.

Validation 9. Moderation completeness.

Validation 10. Proficiency consistency. The proficiency level must be consistent with the evidence.

Validation 11. Date consistency. The date learned must be before the date last reviewed.

Validation 12. Prerequisite consistency. The prerequisites must be learned before the concept.

